      "raw": "Hi. I havent exactly the same problem as brianon, but I ordered my Sentinels of the multiverse on september 15th and although seeing paypal having transferred the payment, there has been no confirmation of my order in any way since then. I dont know whether it has been dispatched already or not. How can I check that? Is there a contact possibility? It leaves one somehow uneasy seeing your money gone without some confirmation that one's order has been noticed...\n\nI might have to add that I am living in Germany and certainly do not expect its arrival by now. ;-)\n\nCheers",
